# Trancycle license

Trancycle uses separate licenses for dictionary content and software.

## Dictionary content and data

Except where a file or media record states otherwise, the original dictionary content in `src/content/terms/` and the generated JSON and CSV exports are licensed under the [Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode).

Reuse must credit "Trancycle contributors", link to https://github.com/mikaello/trancycle, link to the CC BY 4.0 license, and indicate whether changes were made.

Third-party media and quoted material are not covered by this grant and retain their recorded licenses.

## Original diagrams

The original SVG artwork in `src/components/diagrams/BicycleArt.astro` and `src/components/diagrams/DetailArt.astro`, and the original annotation text in `src/data/diagrams.ts`, are licensed under CC BY 4.0 with the same attribution requirements as the dictionary content.
The creator is Trancycle contributors, and the original source is https://github.com/mikaello/trancycle/tree/main/src/components/diagrams.
The drawings were made with AI-assisted SVG code and are not marked as expert-reviewed.
Per-view descriptions and technical reference URLs are recorded in `src/data/diagrams.ts` and rendered beside each diagram.
Reference illustrations were not copied or traced.
The surrounding templates, styles, and interaction code remain software under the MIT License.

